        <argsstring>()</argsstring>
        <name>Calculate</name>
        <qualifiedname>csmp::QuartzPrecipitation::Calculate</qualifiedname>
        <reimplements refid="classcsmp_1_1_interrelation_1a416837f708198b42b157be411d01ec96">Calculate</reimplements>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Calculating how much quartz gets precipitated</para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>calculate quartz solubility at the nodes (done in <ref refid="_quartz_solubility_8h_source" kindref="compound">QuartzSolubility.h</ref>)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>get vector properties flux and solubility gradient in the element</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>project solubility gradient on fluid flux</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>compute product of mass flux, projected solubility gradient, and time. This product gives the amount of quartz that is dissolved or precipitated </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
